699-1f220fb8b040\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-022822e1-770c-4fe4-8213-549ab622fa14\"><b>​​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e13558ed-6b93-44a0-88ed-ac0399d8006c\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8ad4b1b8-39ce-4341-87cb-259aec81e050\">- 11/18(화) 21:30~22:30 경​​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-15eeb1e3-643f-47c0-93be-4cd8022438e0\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-1595daed-dca0-4db9-9e2a-2aaef7359981\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2d0a22ef-28ac-46f5-838b-abb7409bab39\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-06a3364a-600c-4905-824e-5de32053f928\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4e25b83c-ee50-4f88-8ce2-1e802cc55656\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-3712f875-eb08-4034-bfa7-e3593e336f94\">1. 일부 계정에서 미니 게임 REBUILD : EDEN의 주요 임무 완료 후, 다음 임무로 넘어갈 수 없는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-9d869e49-f2a8-433f-921b-cdc7d0f6edb1\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a9ff1a2f-fb67-4cfb-aa00-91f13631e605\">2. 일부 계정에서 미니 게임 REBUILD : EDEN의 [임무/파견] 팝업이 의도와 다르게 동작하는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-994151e5-de11-4abe-aa4c-34c31cc44b57\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-aa4d939e-bfff-4b22-97c4-a9eff6f1a68f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0b92870f-a851-41e6-813e-29c215dca513\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-fcde58a0-3474-4eb5-ad09-8538ce85cb57\">​​​​※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5af9e449-02c6-4b7f-bd06-28a046d3994b\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f4f80015-3fa9-40a9-b9a1-8444f7739edc\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-cf408475-23e2-4c7b-9f5f-a3ae3561c984\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-00cd73b2-007b-4f73-b25e-ffda78b244e7\">·····················································································​​​​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-86f035d7-a93a-4b3a-8554-6140d73e825e\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-75ad22e7-b390-4cd0-a1b4-d56a92483667\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-56bb5ac8-d68b-493e-b80e-88773cb9397a\"><span style=\"\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a7a45018-96c0-415f-bc9e-fe6ac797dd73\">게임 이용에 불편을 드린 점 깊이 사과드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT -->\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <script type=\"text/data\" class=\"__se_module_data\" data-module-v2='{\"type\": \"v2_text\", \"id\": \"SE-f24e88a4-6cd8-48f8-b364-5b7bcc6735a5\", \"data\": {\"ctype\": \"text\"  }}'></script>\n                </div>                <div class=\"se-component se-image se-l-default\" id=\"SE-dd901eea-05af-4e93-b789-f7f220bae181\">\n                    <div class=\"se-compone